### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### ----------------------------------------------------
### PUBLIC ENDPOINTS (No token required)
### ----------------------------------------------------

### 1. Health check - public endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 2. Register a normal user - should return token with role USER
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Normal User",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "User@12345"
}

### 3. Login normal user - copy token from response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "User@12345"
}

### 4. Login seeded admin user - copy token from response
### Seeded admin credentials: admin@example.com / Admin@12345
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### 5. Login with wrong password - should return 401 Unauthorized
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### 6. Register duplicate email - should return 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Duplicate User",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "User@12345"
}


### ----------------------------------------------------
### DAY 9 EXERCISE 3: PROTECTED TICKET ENDPOINTS
### ----------------------------------------------------

### 1. GET tickets without token - Should return 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets

